&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Android fundamentals:&lt;/strong&gt; Understanding of Android architecture components, MVVM, and asynchronous programming with Kotlin Coroutines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;API integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience working with RESTful APIs and Git-based development workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; You care about writing clean, maintainable code and are eager to improve your testing and debugging skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative approach:&lt;/strong&gt; You enjoy solving problems with others, are open to feedback, and communicate confidently in English.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
